Package: luminary
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: Luminary Maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Homepage: https://example.com/luminary
Description: Luminary — Local Media Gallery
 A self-hosted local media gallery and browser for photos and videos.
 .
 This package bundles its own Python runtime (PyInstaller onedir build) —
 no system Python or pip dependencies are required at runtime. The Recommends
 above provide the system tray icon on desktop environments that need an
 AppIndicator/GTK backend for it (e.g. GNOME); on environments with native
 tray support (KDE, XFCE, etc.) they are not required for the tray to work.
